            <ArticleTitle>Talus fracture in a 4-year-old child.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr-2016-215063</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr-2016-215063</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Fracture of the talus is uncommon in childhood. We report a case of talar neck fracture that occurred in a 4-year-old girl. We present the radiological findings, the orthopaedic follow-up and the clinical outcome.</AbstractText>
